OL,3,GNEWSAWoman sentenced after cousin
OL,4,Akilled in XL bully attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Bristol Crown Court, Judge Anna
OL,7,FRichardson sentenced Reed to 18 weeks
OL,8,Fin prison, suspended for 18 months. She
OL,9,Fwill also be required to undergo mental
OL,10,Fhealth treatment.
